<title>USA: Michael Anthony says Andin merger off.</title>
<headline>Michael Anthony says Andin merger off.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNT VERNON, N.Y. 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Michael Anthony Jewelers Inc said on Friday that its merger negotiations with Andin International Inc have ended.</p>
<p>On May 30 the companies had said they signed a preliminary letter of intent to merge in a deal valued at $70 million.</p>
<p>The combination would have created a manufacturer and marketer of jewelry with annual sales of about $280 million.</p>
<p>Michael Anthony said in a Friday news release that it expects to pursue other acquisition opportunities.</p>
</text>
